<p>Your net worth is the single truest scoreboard in personal finance. It is everything you own minus everything you owe, in one honest number. Income tells you what flows in. Net worth tells you what you are actually keeping. Fill in what you can and watch it add up.</p>

<div class="hmca">
  <h3>The Net Worth Calculator</h3>
  <p class="hmca-sub">Add up your assets, subtract your debts, and see where you really stand today.</p>

  <div class="nw-sec nw-assets">What you own (assets)</div>
  <div class="nw-row"><label>Cash and savings</label><div class="nw-in"><span class="pfx">$</span><input type="number" class="nwA" min="0" step="100" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0"></div></div>
  <div class="nw-row"><label>Investments (401k, IRA, brokerage)</label><div class="nw-in"><span class="pfx">$</span><input type="number" class="nwA" min="0" step="100" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0"></div></div>
