  </div>

  <p class="hmca-note"><strong>A negative number is a starting point, not a verdict.</strong> Plenty of people with big incomes have a net worth in the red, and plenty of quiet, steady savers are millionaires. What matters is the direction. Come back once a year, same date, and compare. As long as the trend is up, you are winning.</p>
